{%- comment -%}
Dates of the first and last days under a chart of CI test results.

Parameters:
- results: The "test_results" concise per-file info.
{%- endcomment %}
            <div class="test-results-axis"><span>{{ results.start_date | append: " 00:00:00 +0000" | date: "%b %-d" | escape }}</span><span>{{ results.end_date | append: " 00:00:00 +0000" | date: "%b %-d" | escape }}</span></div>
